2	 * Authentication & Account Routes
3	 *
4	 * REST endpoints for account and token management:
5	 * - GET /api/accounts - List user's linked OAuth accounts
6	 * - GET /api/agents - List OAuth agents (clients) for an organization
7	 * - POST /api/:orgSlug/tokens - Create org-scoped personal access tokens
8	 */
